From 950a4f8d101eb322430d8db2f3104fc6835bab9b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tien Nguyen <tien.nguyen.uh@renesas.com>
Date: Mon, 20 Nov 2023 13:00:51 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] driver: renesas: Add initial RZ/V2H and RZ/G2L, RZ/V2L
 platform support

This patch includes multiple enhancements and fixes for Renesas RZ boards,
adding support for key peripherals and features across the RZ/V2H, RZ/G2L, and RZ/V2L platforms, including:

- Add ADC driver and DT bindings for RZ/V2H
- Enable I3C userspace interface for RZ/V2H-EVK
- Add SCI serial driver with PM and reset support
- Add MTU3 timer driver and DT nodes
- Add POEG driver and DT support
- Add GPT driver and DT nodes for RZ/V2L
- Update clocks, resets, and PM support where needed

Upstream-Status: Pending

Signed-off-by: Tien Nguyen <tien.nguyen.uh@renesas.com>
